From 1e60fbb711189b152087294ed8a70627e6df2e47 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:07:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: self-issued tasks inside a human-signed lane (broker,
 checker, helper)

Checker: trusted_senders ceiling (sender_not_trusted), self-issued signing
domain, issued_under_grant shape/purpose checks, step 2b issuance checks.
Broker: issue_task op with task_issue receipts, issue store, optional limits,
grant re-checks at claim/propose/staged/dispatch, task_origin on receipts.
Setup: synthe-issuer key and registry entry, trusted_senders by default.
git-remote-synthe: issue fallback with persisted request_id, push options.
Tests and docs not yet written.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
